@ibrahimgazlih
Cutting off electricity due to fuel scarcity threatens the lives of the injured and patients in Al-Shifa Hospital amid continued bombing and aggression.

Warning: Disturbing content
Several Palestinian children were severely injured after an Israeli airstrike hit a home sheltering displaced members of the Mushtaha family in Sheikh Radwan, Gaza City. The wounded, including multiple children, were rushed to Al-Shifa Hospital.
@PressTV

▶️ The Israeli army's complete destruction of Kamal Adwan Hospital in northern Gaza has left behind horrifying scenes of rubble and devastation, with the surrounding area utterly devastated by the military action
.
@PressTV

Posted 7 August 2025 @eye.on.palestine on Instagram | The child Taha Al-Muqadamah (15) lost his sight completely after being shot by Israeli forces near a GHF distribution center close to the Netzarim corridor, central Gaza, on July 27, 2025. Taha is an orphan, his father and breadwinning brother were killed during the raid on Al-Shifa Hospital last year. He now relies on food aid to survive. By
@atiadarwish
